    <innerclass refid="classterminal_1_1_modal_window" prot="public">terminal::ModalWindow</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespaceterminal">terminal</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Terminal-specific modal window wrapper over <ref refid="classjam_1_1_modal_window" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::ModalWindow</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_modal_window" kindref="compound">terminal::ModalWindow</ref> is a thin wrapper that delegates the generic modal setup sequence (centreAroundComponent, setGlass, setVisible, enterModalState) to <ref refid="classjam_1_1_modal_window" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::ModalWindow</ref>&apos;s caller-ctor.</para>
<para>This wrapper retains Terminal-specific concerns only:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>terminal::Display::onRepaintNeeded callback</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>paint() border drawn from Config colour/size keys</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>keyPressed() override</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>cornerSize platform constants</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classjam_1_1_modal_window" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::ModalWindow</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_popup" kindref="compound">terminal::Popup</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classaction_1_1_list" kindref="compound">action::List</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
